sentences.l:
And lying they say you are the offspring of aegis-bearing Zeus,
since you fall far short of those men
who were born of Zeus in the time of earlier men;

who once, coming here for the sake of Laomedon’s horses,
with only six ships and fewer men,
plundered utterly the city of Ilios, and widowed the streets;

And to you I say here slaughter and the black death-fate
from me will be brought about, and, subdued under my spear,
a boast to me you will give, and your soul to Hades of the famous horses.”

this no one took thought of, nor noticed,
to draw the ashen spear out of the thigh, so that he might step on it,
they being in haste;
